                  "heading": "Overview"
                },
                "text": "Cendara University offers a comprehensive range of academic programs through its constituent schools and departments. Our commitment to fostering innovation, leadership, and critical inquiry is reflected in the diversity and rigor of our degree offerings. Below is a summary of all degrees, schools, departments, and specialized programs currently available at Cendara University."
